cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its method, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "causal-decidability: planning and checking discriminating causal experiments in mechanistic interpretability"
abstract: >-
  A successful intervention on a language model can fit several causal
  explanations. This procedure helps you check which of them a planned
  experiment can distinguish at all.
authors:
